### Database Resources

This tool relies on several external annotation resources that are updated periodically.

The current versions included in this repository were downloaded in *August 2026*:

- go-basic.obo
- kegg_pathway_titles.tsv
- pfam_duf_map.tsv

Before using this tool for new analyses, we recommend checking whether newer versions of these resources are available.

## Official Sources

- [Gene_Ontology_(GO)](https://geneontology.org/docs/download-ontology/)
- [KEGG_Pathway](https://www.kegg.jp/kegg/pathway.html#global)
- [Pfam_InterPro](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/interpro/)
